            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Supermunn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The way we make it is, we cook grated onion with olive oil, a table spoon of tomato paste and a table spoon of red pepper paste. Then add this to softened bulgur. then add green onions, parsley, salt, red pepper flakes, lemon juice and /or pomegranate molasses. We don't put tomato, cucumber or red bell peppers into kisir. But I'm sure that makes it delicious :)",
